It's always the s[Dm]ame, it's just a s[Am]hame, that's al[Dm]l.
I could say [Gm7]day, and you'd say [C]night,
Tell me it's [Gm7]black when I know that it's [C]white
Always the [Gm7]same, it's just a [C]shame, that's [Dm]all. (Chorus)
